#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"A hidden category, with everything inside it, stays out of charts where it "
"would be shown on its own, so a large one such as Rent doesn't crowd out the "
"rest. A chart that leaves categories out says so, with the amount. Groups "
"and the key figures always count everything."
